chezmoi dots view — Preview rendered dotfiles

USAGE
  chezmoi dots view [<what>] [options]

ARGUMENTS
  what  Registry entry, source path or target path. Required unless --matrix or --all requests an overview.
  Default: render the current configuration; --matrix/--all render all nine OS/role configurations.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.
  --all  overview across all registry entries (default: "false")
  --as <os[,role]>  render one os[,role] (darwin|linux|windows; personal|work|light) (default: "")
  --matrix  render every configuration (default: "false")

ENVIRONMENT
  CHEZMOI_EXECUTABLE  chezmoi executable (default: chezmoi).
  CHEZMOI_CONFIG_FILE  chezmoi config file (default: chezmoi's config).
  CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR  source directory (default: ask chezmoi; honors .chezmoiroot).

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots view shell
  chezmoi dots view shell --as linux,work
  chezmoi dots view --matrix
